Hello,

You should use a dynamic UI with renderUI.

In ui.R :
radioButtons("choose", "Choose:", list(selectInput="select", numericInput="numeric")),
uiOutput("widget")

In server.R :
output$widget <- renderUI({
   if(input$choose=="select"){
   return(selectInput("country", "Country", ...))
   }else{
      return(numericInput("latitude", ......))
   }
})

