Hi all,

I would like to check if a textInput has been completed, and then run an operation based on this. For some reason, the following simplified code does not work. Is there something wrong (sorry for my ignorance) ?
library(shiny)

ui <- pageWithSidebar(
headerPanel("TEST"),
sidebarPanel(

textInput('C1', "","C1")
),

mainPanel(uiOutput("value"))

)

server <- function(input,output){

output$value <- renderUI({
#input$C1

if (is.null(input$C1)){
value <- 0}
else{
value <- 1
}
})

}

runApp(list(ui=ui,server=server))

Any suggestion highly appreciated.

Cheers
